COMPILATION OF: E52VK

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52VK

   1 a 0000 E52VK: procedure options(main);
   2 a 0006 
   3 a 0006    /* E2E-52/P3-9 probe VK (PLAN sec P3-9 H10): UNMEASURED
   4 a 0006       boundaries, verdicts recorded VERBATIM, NO byte
   5 a 0006       prediction: precedence a | (b & c); a parenthesised OR
   6 a 0006       group inside AND; the OR in VALUE position stored to
   7 a 0006       bit(1). */
   8 a 0006 
   9 c 0006    dcl dl fixed binary;
  10 c 0006    dcl m fixed binary;
  11 c 0006    dcl fm fixed binary;
  12 c 0006    dcl b bit(1);
  13 c 0006    dcl x fixed bin;
  14 c 0006 
  15 c 0006    if dl < 0 | m = fm & dl > 2 then x = 1;
  16 c 0030    x = 2;
  17 c 0036    if (dl < 0 | dl > 2) & m = fm then x = 3;
  18 c 0060    x = 4;
  19 c 0066    b = (dl < 0 | dl > 2);
  20 c 0077    x = 5;
  21 c 007D 
  22 a 007D end E52VK;

CODE SIZE = 0080
DATA AREA = 0009
FREE SYMS = 386C
END  COMPILATION
